<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span><h1>Receipt Maker KH Privacy Policy</h1><p>Pre-release privacy information for Receipt Maker KH.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><p><strong>Last updated: August 20, 2026</strong></p><p><strong>Status: Pre-release draft.</strong> This policy will be reviewed against the final app implementation before publication on Google Play.</p><h2>1. Scope</h2><p>This Privacy Policy applies to Receipt Maker KH, a Kroma Digital application for creating and managing receipts.</p><h2>2. Data handling</h2><p>The final data-handling behavior will depend on the released version of the app. Before release, Kroma Digital will verify how receipt data, customer details, business information, generated files, and related records are stored and whether any information leaves the device.</p><h2>3. Files and permissions</h2><p>If the app creates, saves, exports, prints, or shares receipt files such as PDF documents or images, the required file, media, printing, or sharing permissions and data flows will be documented here before release.</p><h2>4. Third-party services</h2><p>If the released app uses billing, analytics, crash reporting, advertising, cloud storage, printing, or other third-party SDKs, this policy will identify the relevant services and their purpose.</p><h2>5. Data retention and deletion</h2><p>The final release policy will explain where receipt-related data is stored, how users can remove records and generated files, and whether any server-side deletion process is required.</p><h2>6. Security</h2><p>Kroma Digital will use reasonable safeguards appropriate to the final implementation and the sensitivity of any business or customer information processed by the app.</p><h2>7. Changes</h2><p>This pre-release policy may change during development. The version published at this URL when the app is released will reflect the final implementation.</p><h2>8. Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions can be sent through the Kroma Digital Facebook page linked on our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>